    "Opening %@ in Terminal, in the brief's folder. It will ask what is wrong in %@; it can check, try and install the plugin itself." : {
      "comment" : "Making a plugin with an AI tool: the tool, then the app",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
